---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
	title="Affordable Gym Membership Chennai | COZ Fitness Pricing"
	description="Check out the most affordable gym membership in Chennai and Ambattur. Annual plans starting at ₹8,888."
	keywords="gym membership chennai, gym fees ambattur, affordable gym Chennai, fitness center price"
>
	<section class="page-header">
		<div class="container animate text-center">
			<span class="tag">Membership Plans</span>
			<h1 class="text-white mt-4">Invest In Your <span class="text-red">Future</span></h1>
			<p class="text-white opacity-8 max-width-800 mx-auto">Flexible plans designed to accommodate your transformation goals and schedule.</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section-padding">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="intro-text text-center max-width-800 mx-auto">
				<span class="tag">Zero Hidden Fees</span>
				<h2 class="mt-4">Transparent Premium Fitness</h2>
				<p class="intro-desc">We believe in delivering ultimate value. Our pricing is straightforward, providing you access to elite equipment and a transformation-focused community in the heart of Ambattur.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="pricing-container mt-5">
				<div class="pricing-tier">
					<div class="tier-header">
						<h3>Basic Annual</h3>
						<p>Perfect for solo warriors</p>
					</div>
					<div class="tier-price">
						<small>₹</small>8,888<small>/Year</small>
					</div>
					<ul class="tier-features">
						<li>Full Access to Jerai Equipment</li>
						<li>General Coaching Support</li>
						<li>Locker & Shower Access</li>
						<li>Standard Hours Access</li>
					</ul>
					<a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline btn-full">Get Started</a>
				</div>

				<div class="pricing-tier popular">
					<div class="popular-tag">Most Popular</div>
					<div class="tier-header">
						<h3>Couple Annual</h3>
						<p>Stay fit together with a partner</p>
					</div>
					<div class="tier-price">
						<small>₹</small>14,999<small>/Year</small>
					</div>
					<ul class="tier-features">
						<li>Everything in Basic for 2 People</li>
						<li>Partner Workout Programs</li>
						<li>2 Comprehensive Fitness Audits</li>
						<li>Priority Support & Desk Access</li>
					</ul>
					<a href="https://wa.me/919514286000" class="btn btn-full">Join as Couple</a>
				</div>

				<div class="pricing-tier">
					<div class="tier-header">
						<h3>90-Day Elite</h3>
						<p>Intensive result-oriented plan</p>
					</div>
					<div class="tier-price">
						<small>₹</small>19,999<small>/Total</small>
					</div>
					<ul class="tier-features">
						<li>Dedicated Personal Trainer</li>
						<li>Full Nutrition Mapping</li>
						<li>Bi-weekly Body Stat Audits</li>
						<li>Guaranteed Transformation</li>
					</ul>
					<a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline btn-full">Join the Elite</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section-padding bg-light">
		<div class="container seo-long-form">
			<h2>Unbeatable Gym Membership Value in Chennai</h2>
			<p>When searching for a **gym membership in Chennai**, many facilities overwhelm you with complex tiers and hidden registration costs. At COZ Fitness, we prioritize simplicity and transparency. Our ₹8,888 annual plan is optimized to be the most competitive entry point for high-standard fitness in Ambattur and surrounding areas.</p>
			
			<div class="spacer-80"></div>

			<h3>The ROI of a Premium Training Environment</h3>
			<p>Sticking to a routine is easier when the environment is clean, the equipment is reliable, and the community is supportive. This is the **COZ Standard**. By investing in your health at the **best gym in Ambattur**, you are ensuring that your fitness journey is sustainable, rewarding, and results-driven.</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section-padding">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="text-center mb-5">
				<span class="tag">Common Queries</span>
				<h2 class="mt-4">Membership FAQ</h2>
			</div>
			<div class="faq-list max-width-800 mx-auto">
				<details>
					<summary>Are there any hidden registration fees?</summary>
					<p>Our pricing is transparent. Most annual plans are inclusive of base registration. We believe in building trust from day one, so what you see is what you pay.</p>
				</details>
				<details>
					<summary>Can I switch plans later?</summary>
					<p>Yes, members can upgrade their plans at any time by paying the differential cost. Our goal is to ensure you have the best program for your current needs and goals.</p>
				</details>
				<details>
					<summary>Do you offer temporary membership freezes?</summary>
					<p>While memberships are non-refundable, we offer a "Freeze" facility for up to 30 days for medical or travel reasons on our annual plans, ensuring you don't lose value.</p>
				</details>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section-padding bg-red text-center">
		<div class="container">
			<h2 class="text-white">Still Have Questions About Pricing?</h2>
			<p class="text-white opacity-8 mb-4">Our front desk team is available 18 hours a day to assist you.</p>
			<a href="tel:+919514286000" class="btn btn-white">Call Our Front Desk</a>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>

<style>
	.page-header {
		height: 60vh;
		background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.6), rgba(0,0,0,0.4)), url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1574673139082-13d8d3898ffb?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=1470') center/cover;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
	}

    .page-header h1 { font-size: 4.5rem; text-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); }

    .tag {
		background: var(--accent-color);
		color: var(--primary-color);
		padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem;
		border-radius: 8px;
		font-weight: 800;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		letter-spacing: 1.5px;
	}

    .intro-desc { font-size: 1.3rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }

	.pricing-container {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		gap: 3rem;
		align-items: stretch;
	}

	.pricing-tier {
		background: var(--bg-color);
		padding: 5rem 3.5rem;
		border-radius: 40px;
		border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
		text-align: center;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		transition: var(--transition);
		position: relative;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
	}

	.pricing-tier.popular {
		border-color: var(--primary-color);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
		transform: scale(1.05);
		z-index: 2;
	}

	.popular-tag {
		position: absolute;
		top: 0;
		left: 50%;
		transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
		background: var(--primary-color);
		color: #fff;
		padding: 0.75rem 2rem;
		border-radius: 50px;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 2px;
	}

	.tier-header h3 { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--text-color); font-size: 1.75rem; }
	.tier-header p { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--text-secondary); font-weight: 600; }

	.tier-price {
		font-size: 4rem;
		font-weight: 950;
		margin: 3rem 0;
		color: var(--primary-color);
		line-height: 1;
	}

	.cur { font-size: 2rem; vertical-align: top; margin-top: 0.5rem; display: inline-block; }
	.tier-price small { font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--text-secondary); font-weight: 700; }

	.tier-features {
		margin-bottom: 4rem;
		flex-grow: 1;
		text-align: left;
	}

	.tier-features li {
		margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
		padding-left: 2.5rem;
		position: relative;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		font-size: 1.1rem;
	}

	.tier-features li::before {
		content: '✓';
		position: absolute;
		left: 0;
		color: var(--primary-color);
		font-weight: 900;
        font-size: 1.25rem;
	}

	.btn-full { width: 100%; border-radius: 100px; }

    .faq-list details {
		background: var(--bg-color);
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		padding: 2.5rem;
		border-radius: 20px;
		box-shadow: var(--shadow);
		cursor: pointer;
        border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
	}

	.faq-list summary {
		font-weight: 900;
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		list-style: none;
		position: relative;
		padding-right: 2rem;
	}

	.faq-list summary::after {
		content: '+';
		position: absolute;
		right: 0;
		color: var(--primary-color);
        font-size: 1.5rem;
	}

    .seo-long-form {
        max-width: 950px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .seo-long-form p { font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 2; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .spacer-80 { height: 80px; }
    .mt-4 { margin-top: 2rem; }
    .mt-5 { margin-top: 4rem; }
    .opacity-8 { opacity: 0.8; }

	@media (max-width: 992px) {
		.page-header { height: auto; padding: 12rem 0 8rem; text-align: center; }
        .page-header h1 { font-size: 3.5rem; }
		.pricing-container { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 4rem; padding: 0 1rem; }
		.pricing-tier.popular { transform: scale(1); }
        .intro-text { text-align: center; }
	}

    @media (max-width: 576px) {
        .page-header h1 { font-size: 2.75rem; }
        .pricing-tier { padding: 4rem 2rem; }
        .tier-price { font-size: 3.5rem; }
    }
</style>
